[1.046802, "o", "  2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent viewport scrolls _HistoryViewport.offset and returns HistoryAction with render_hist\u001b[8;64Hory=True and forwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream input.\u001b[9;64H"]
[1.064935, "o", "  3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when action.forwarded_input is set; empty means nothing reaches tmux. The overlay is painted client-s\u001b[10;64Hide via surface.paint_overlays.\u001b[11;64H"]
[1.083129, "o", "  4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-mode; the implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane would enter \u001b[12;64Hcopy-mode, which is deliberately avoided.\u001b[13;64H"]
