opy-mode, which is deliberately avoided.\u001b[K\u001b[13;64H  Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts agent_action.forwarded_i\u001b[14;64Hnput == b\"\".\u001b[K\u001b[15;64H  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the overlay rendered rather than merely dropping the event.\u001b[K\u001b[16;64H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[38;5;147m\u001b[39;64H❯\u001b[39m \u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[40;64H───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[41;64H  ⏵⏵ normal mode · shift+tab to cycle · ← for agents\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[48;5;70m\r\n Railmux · Claude Code · ▣                                                                                                                                                               \u001b[38;5;231m→ new session in railmux\u001b[30m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[41;116H"]
